SEAM-EXTRACTION: make ONE pure predicate the single authority for quest<->event matching, so the generic-kill quest can never match the kill_type echo of the same kill. Do NOT patch onMobKill's two-event dispatch (line 317-318) — the fan-out is correct; the defect is that the match rule counts one kill twice.

