  }, [grid]);
(RECIPES is a stable module import; dropping it from the dep array is correct and keeps exhaustive-deps happy since matchRecipe/RECIPES are module-level constants.)

matchRecipe is now the ONE canonical accessor the panel and the gate both call — no duplicated match logic, no hydrate-once mirror.

